conda-forge/smesh-feedstock recipe/patches/0005-occt-8.0-netgen-occ.patch: the OCCT 8.0 pass
on the netgen OCC geometry files (netgen 6.2.2101, after netgen62ForSalome.patch and
occgenmesh_OCCT76.patch).

Source: conda-forge/smesh-feedstock, `recipe/patches/0005-occt-8.0-netgen-occ.patch`, commit
c54d26ae6 ("Fix build against OCCT 8.0.0", 2026-06-23), verbatim from its "Subject:" line on.
Its paths keep the `src/Netgen` prefix of the conda layout, so `prepare.py` applies the patch
at the staged top. Its hunks of occgeom.hpp, occgeom.cpp, occpkg.cpp and occgenmesh.cpp
apply at fuzz 0 on the SALOME-patched 6.2.2101 tree. occpkg.cpp holds the Tcl/Tk GUI
package of netgen and is not compiled; its hunk is kept so that the patch stays verbatim.

Subject: [PATCH] OCCT 8.0.0 compatibility for bundled Netgen occ geometry

Equivalent of the upstream Netgen_occt800.patch hunks for the bundled
src/Netgen/libsrc/occ files, applied against this release's (unpatched)
Netgen sources: the global Handle_<Class> typedefs were removed in OCCT
8.0.0 (use the Handle() macro), the TopTools_ListIteratorOfListOfShape.hxx
instantiation header was removed (use the collection header), and OCCT
8.0.0 trimmed transitive includes (add the now-required TopTools_*
collection headers).
